 {"id":"registrytext","type":"text","x":1570,"y":915,"width":380,"height":135,"text":"AUXILIARY REGISTRY + VOLUME\nfloci-aws-forge-ci-ecr-registry\nVolume: floci-aws-ecr-registry-data\n\nregistry:2 pinned · CI + default bridge\nDocker daemon pushes via localhost:4566\nCleanup asserted by test ecr","originalText":"AUXILIARY REGISTRY + VOLUME\nfloci-aws-forge-ci-ecr-registry\nVolume: floci-aws-ecr-registry-data\n\nregistry:2 pinned · CI + default bridge\nDocker daemon pushes via localhost:4566\nCleanup asserted by test ecr","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":2,"strokeColor":"#9a3412","lineHeight":1.25},
 {"id":"registryarrow","type":"arrow","x":1465,"y":985,"width":80,"height":0,"points":[[0,0],[80,0]],"strokeColor":"#ea580c","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":0,"endArrowhead":"arrow","startArrowhead":null},
 {"id":"registryhint","type":"text","x":1565,"y":790,"width":380,"height":65,"text":"Floci starts registry through host Docker.\nFloci proxies /v2 traffic to the registry.\nOnly exists during local ECR tests.","originalText":"Floci starts registry through host Docker.\nFloci proxies /v2 traffic to the registry.\nOnly exists during local ECR tests.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":2,"strokeColor":"#9a3412","lineHeight":1.25},
 {"id":"hostnote","type":"text","x":90,"y":1100,"width":1830,"height":70,"text":"NETWORK: controller + service jobs + Floci use forge-ci-local. No host artifact port or permanent UFW exception.\nSMOKE: job uses bridge and no socket; controller still uses DooD. SECURITY: socket access is broad host control, not an untrusted-code sandbox.\nLIFECYCLE: topology shown when running; stopped at closure. Images/caches/private artifacts retained; no global Docker prune.","originalText":"NETWORK: controller + service jobs + Floci use forge-ci-local. No host artifact port or permanent UFW exception.\nSMOKE: job uses bridge and no socket; controller still uses DooD. SECURITY: socket access is broad host control, not an untrusted-code sandbox.\nLIFECYCLE: topology shown when running; stopped at closure. Images/caches/private artifacts retained; no global Docker prune.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":2,"strokeColor":"#475569","lineHeight":1.25},
 {"id":"forge","type":"rectangle","x":70,"y":1240,"width":730,"height":180,"strokeColor":"#844fba","backgroundColor":"#faf5ff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":0,"roundness":{"type":3}},
