 {"id":"forgego","type":"image","x":175,"y":1270,"width":80,"height":60,"fileId":"go","status":"saved","scale":[1,1]},
 {"id":"forgetext","type":"text","x":285,"y":1260,"width":495,"height":135,"text":"./forge — separate tools container on this host\nGo · Terraform · AWS CLI\n\nRepo mounted; no Docker socket; not an ACT runner.\nIts localhost is NOT the host localhost.\nAuxiliary tooling, not another pipeline stage.","originalText":"./forge — separate tools container on this host\nGo · Terraform · AWS CLI\n\nRepo mounted; no Docker socket; not an ACT runner.\nIts localhost is NOT the host localhost.\nAuxiliary tooling, not another pipeline stage.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":2,"strokeColor":"#6b21a8","lineHeight":1.25},
 {"id":"evidence","type":"text","x":850,"y":1250,"width":850,"height":165,"text":"EVIDENCE BOUNDARIES\n\nLocal: transfer, Floci STS/ECR, immutable rejection and cleanup passed.\nSeparate real runs: hosted verify, OIDC, ECR push/digest passed;\nnon-main subject explicitly denied by STS. AWS resources removed.\n\nNot tested: cold/second host, real pull/lifecycle expiry, production deployment.","originalText":"EVIDENCE BOUNDARIES\n\nLocal: transfer, Floci STS/ECR, immutable rejection and cleanup passed.\nSeparate real runs: hosted verify, OIDC, ECR push/digest passed;\nnon-main subject explicitly denied by STS. AWS resources removed.\n\nNot tested: cold/second host, real pull/lifecycle expiry, production deployment.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":2,"strokeColor":"#334155","lineHeight":1.25},
 {"id":"credits","type":"text","x":70,"y":1460,"width":1600,"height":65,"text":"Brand SVGs: Simple Icons — simpleicons.org / cdn.simpleicons.org (CC0 collection; trademarks belong to their owners).\nNeovim · GitHub Actions (workflow format, not the ACT project logo) · Docker · Go · Terraform. Other symbols are generic illustrations.\nCOLOR KEY: blue = execution/control; purple = artifact transfer; orange = emulated AWS/registry. Final Lab 003 topology.","originalText":"Brand SVGs: Simple Icons — simpleicons.org / cdn.simpleicons.org (CC0 collection; trademarks belong to their owners).\nNeovim · GitHub Actions (workflow format, not the ACT project logo) · Docker · Go · Terraform. Other symbols are generic illustrations.\nCOLOR KEY: blue = execution/control; purple = artifact transfer; orange = emulated AWS/registry. Final Lab 003 topology.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"strokeColor":"#64748b","lineHeight":1.25}
